# Leftovers from the retired shell pipeline: chat exports and the narrowed
# subsets built from them. These hold real message ids, file names and text from
# an account. The Go binary reads the chat live and writes none of them, but the
# files may still be sitting in a working copy. The repo ships no JSON of its
# own, so the whole extension is excluded.
*.json
missing-ids.txt

# Staging holds media in flight between the download and upload legs.
staging/

# Run logs carry chat names and progress output.
*.log

# Session plans and reports.
plans/

# Go build output
/tgexport
/tgexport-slim
